    {
      "id": "h2hHotYLNhRd3U7NlVoob",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3550.433812134946,
      "y": -168.50283290504183,
      "width": 1710.3125,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAj",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 331459958,
      "version": 789,
      "versionNonce": 488642215,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "注意: 从仿真不能完成的事情:要注意这里所有的东西都是模拟的即使是时序验证,它那个时序同样是模拟的,其实他依然是一个顺序执行的代码模型,只是一个假的时序图，它并不是真实的时序，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "注意: 从仿真不能完成的事情:要注意这里所有的东西都是模拟的即使是时序验证,它那个时序同样是模拟的,其实他依然是一个顺序执行的代码模型,只是一个假的时序图，它并不是真实的时序，",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "Xxe8rfvUhIUFzQ-qxpXyn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3550.4338121304086,
      "y": -128.74318279006764,
      "width": 1560,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAk",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1834520246,
      "version": 912,
      "versionNonce": 106211783,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所以它并不是真正的物理意义上的那个时序图有信号的延迟，他在图上看还是在特定的时间点一瞬间就全部改变了，所以无法反映出真正的时序的细节，比如说门延迟，线延迟，",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "所以它并不是真正的物理意义上的那个时序图有信号的延迟，他在图上看还是在特定的时间点一瞬间就全部改变了，所以无法反映出真正的时序的细节，比如说门延迟，线延迟，",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "WXkL2s64iMN5v3FN2s4GP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3550.433812315677,
      "y": -89.56676320189797,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1275152374,
      "version": 965,
      "versionNonce": 2110380263,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "它的信号不是那种一个接着一个像流水一样瀑布一样往后级联一样变化的",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "它的信号不是那种一个接着一个像流水一样瀑布一样往后级联一样变化的",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "D793IwH6xwkkaap75_2ga",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3557.131415760989,
      "y": -49.22388320189782,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAm",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1606474038,
      "version": 1061,
      "versionNonce": 688661511,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "所以这些仿真都没有办法知道会不会出现时序不收敛，亚稳态的情况",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "所以这些仿真都没有办法知道会不会出现时序不收敛，亚稳态的情况",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "BCJeMn5IpRwhDKnOE_k8R",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3550.4338123491593,
      "y": 121.25681708381671,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAn",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 268190326,
      "version": 1093,
      "versionNonce": 1209535271,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "那如何能得到真正的时序？",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "那如何能得到真正的时序？",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "hu5vq2Fde0bDrv_ZkCaZw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3659.608885903847,
      "y": 152.71976035278976,
      "width": 351.71875,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAo",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 259556278,
      "version": 1121,
      "versionNonce": 1733955143,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① 通过静态时序分析可以作出初步判断",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "① 通过静态时序分析可以作出初步判断",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "oBbalfjeYamaSifQkhs28",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3659.608886458535,
      "y": 200.7761164789058,
      "width": 570.3125,
      "height": 72,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1884986614,
      "version": 1207,
      "versionNonce": 1370402151,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "② 后仿真(布局布线之后对 门级网表+时序信息 一起进行仿真)\n\n③ 上板验证(流片或者fpga)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "② 后仿真(布局布线之后对 门级网表+时序信息 一起进行仿真)\n\n③ 上板验证(流片或者fpga)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "BZjD6Kch2UojN2QO0nQnd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3667.1314148871056,
      "y": -205.87347523538028,
      "width": 530.3125,
      "height": 24,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAq",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 942116406,
      "version": 294,
      "versionNonce": 1113745543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "RTL 仿真阶段，所有的逻辑门和连线都被理想化为“零延迟”",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "RTL 仿真阶段，所有的逻辑门和连线都被理想化为“零延迟”",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "ROIAwDchuRShBXGRtfjV6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4311.215061920589,
      "y": -89.56676323538056,
      "width": 799.21875,
      "height": 48,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bAr",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1942247286,
      "version": 659,
      "versionNonce": 1462878119,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1766959159064,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "初始化与复位问题： 异步复位撤离（Recovery/Removal）如果不满足时序要求，可能导\n致芯片复位后进入随机状态。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "初始化与复位问题： 异步复位撤离（Recovery/Removal）如果不满足时序要求，可能导致芯片复位后进入随机状态。",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
